  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ending Violence Against Women and Girls UN Women and UNFPA Activities (Indo-Pacific) 2020-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding for Indo-Pacific regional and global UN Women and United Nations Population Fund (UNFPA) ending violence against women and girls programs. These programs focus on: violence prevention; access to support services for survivors, including justice; and supporting monitoring, evaluation and learning on what works to end violence, including capacity for measuring violence against women and girls. The programs funded under this investment include the UN Joint Programme on Essential Services, UN Trust Fund to End Violence against Women, UN Women Prevention Activities and UNFPA&apos;s kNOwVAWdata program.</narrative>
  </description>
